	(text "The coil negative has spikes of a few hundred volts at every spark.\n1N4007 passes only the positive ones, 2 × 22 kΩ 1 W limit the current, the 15 V\nzener and the 2.2 nF clip the spike; the H11L1 (Schmitt trigger) gives a clean edge.\nTachometer wire and waveform [TO VERIFY] with the oscilloscope."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
